From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "electron-claude[bot]"
 <279139701+electron-claude[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:32:42 +0000
Subject: src: stop using deprecated ArrayBufferView::Buffer()

V8 deprecated `v8::ArrayBufferView::Buffer()` and
`v8::WasmMemoryObject::Buffer()` in favour of `GetBuffer()`, which
returns the new `v8::ArrayBufferBase` type that covers both ArrayBuffer
and SharedArrayBuffer, and has since removed them. Switch every caller
to `GetBuffer()`, casting back to `v8::ArrayBuffer` only where a plain
ArrayBuffer is required: detaching it (SharedArrayBuffers are never
detachable) or handing it to code that constructs views over it.

Refs: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/8714721
Refs: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/8794471

